{%- comment -%}
  MISC policy template. Policy templates must be Liquid (Shopify
  does not allow JSON templates for the `policy` type), so this
  renders the misc-policy section as a static section. The section
  still shows in the Theme Editor with its settings.
  Applies to all shop policies (Privacy, Refund, Terms, Shipping).
{%- endcomment -%}
